<div style="color:#111111;" class="rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:2:22"><p>
	 
</p>

<p>
	The word ‘Hope’ is defined as a feeling of expectation and desire for certain things to happen, and with our dedicated staff, life-changing outcomes can happen when you enter our Center of Hope.
</p>

<p>
	Our doors are open daily to single adults, families, seniors, and the disabled who have no other option for safe shelter. Keeping with our mission “to meet human needs without discrimination,” we not only offer dormitory-style housing for single guests and apartments for families, but we provide showers and hot meals.
</p>

<p>
	 
</p></div>
<div class="py-5" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-xl:3:28"></div>
<div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:300px;background-image:url('https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/e94f0f47-ae74-4090-8a13-6b07cc2c4105_Blue+BG.png');background-position:center center;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:cover;" class="text-white rounded p-6 gap-3 my-5" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:4:93">
            <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;"></div>
            <div style="position:relative;z-index:3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;min-height:300px;">
                <div style="width:100%;padding:40px;color:#FFFFFF;">
                    <h5 style="text-align:center;"><br>
Our care does not end there.</h5>

<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
	Our Center of Hope also provides help for those in need of:
</p>

<ul>
	<li>Social services</li>
	<li>Physical and mental health services</li>
	<li>Affordable housing</li>
	<li>Workforce development </li>
	<li>Rental, electricity and transportation assistance</li>
	<li>Food</li>
</ul>

<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
	For more information or for any questions,<br>
	Please call our Social Services Department  at <a href="tel:+15048994569" target="">(504) 899-4569</a>.<br>
	 
</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
<div style="color:#111111;" class="rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:7:13"><h5 style="text-align:center;"> </h5>

<h5 style="text-align:center;">Registration Days and Hours</h5>

<p style="text-align:center;">
	<strong>Monday thru Thursday</strong> from 4:00pm
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;">
	<strong>No weekend</strong> entries at this time
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;">
	For more information or for any questions, please call our Social Services Department at <a href="tel:504-899-4569" target="">(504) 899-4569</a>.
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;">
	 
</p></div>
<div class="py-5" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-xl:8:8"></div>
<div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:300px;background-image:url('https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/e94f0f47-ae74-4090-8a13-6b07cc2c4105_Blue+BG.png');background-position:center center;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:cover;" class="text-white rounded p-6 gap-3 my-5" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:9:7">
            <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;"></div>
            <div style="position:relative;z-index:3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;min-height:300px;">
                <div style="width:100%;padding:40px;color:#FFFFFF;">
                    <div class="btgrid">
	<div class="row row-1">
		<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
			<div class="content">
				<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
					<img src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/6c35ef4a-020e-4e25-9d5a-fd2223e6f482_IMG_48603.jpeg" style="display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;" class="d-block mx-auto img-fluid rounded">
				</p>

				<h6 style="text-align:center;">Overnight Emergency Shelter</h6>

				<ul>
					<li>Clients can utilize overnight emergency shelter for 30 – 90 days (first 7 days free, followed by $10 per night thereafter)</li>
					<li>Full breakfast and dinner provided</li>
					<li>Clients are allowed to bring 2 bags into facility</li>
					<li>After initial entry, a bed in the Center of Hope will be reserved for the client until departur</li>
					<li>Clients depart Center of Hope by 7:00 am and can return to facility at 4:00 pm (curfew is 6:00 pm)</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
			<div class="content">
				<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
					<img src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/b6cd37f0-9085-4bd5-8184-17b672371e8a_IMG_4860.jpeg" style="display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;" class="d-block mx-auto img-fluid rounded">
				</p>

				<h6 style="text-align:center;">Shelter Check-In Process</h6>

				<ul>
					<li>Potential shelter clients must pre-register for entry</li>
					<li>Those needing shelter will need a current (State Issued) photo ID in order to enter</li>
					<li>Must have a current tb test showing a negative result</li>
					<li>Recently tested for COVID-19 and have written documentation of when and the result</li>
					<li>No after-hours walk-ins accepted</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
